SUMMARY:FJORD
LOCATION:UW Cinematheque\, 4070 Vilas Hall\, 821 University Ave\, Madison\
 , WI 53706
DESCRIPTION:Romania\, France\, Norway\, Sweden\, Denmark | 2026 | DCP | 14
 6 min. | Romanian\, Norwegian\, English\, Swedish with English subtitles\
 n\nDirector: Cristian Mungiu\n\nCast: Sebastian Stan\, Renate Reinsve\n\n
 Winner of the Palme d’Or at the 2026 Cannes Film Festival\, Fjord stars
  Sebastian Stan and Renate Reinsve as a devout couple who move their fami
 ly from Romania to Norway. Their belief system puts them at odds with the
 ir new\, overwhelmingly secular community. The latest from 4 Months\, 3 W
 eeks and 2 Days director Cristian Mungiu is a characteristically knotty i
 nquiry into the double standards of liberal tolerance. (MK)\n\nhttps://ci
 nema.wisc.edu/events/fjord/\n\nSource: UW Cinematheque
URL:https://cinema.wisc.edu/events/fjord/
END:VEVENT
