SUMMARY:CARRIE
LOCATION:UW Cinematheque\, 4070 Vilas Hall\, 821 University Ave\, Madison\
 , WI 53706
DESCRIPTION:USA | 1976 | 35mm | 97 min.\n\nDirector: Brian De Palma\n\nCas
 t: Sissy Spacek\, Piper Laurie\, John Travolta\n\nIn the ultra-stylish fi
 rst screen adaptation of Stephen King’s pop novel\, Spacek gives an Osc
 ar-nominated performance as the much-abused adolescent who uses her telek
 inetic powers to exact revenge on her tormentors. De Palma elevates teen-
 horror movies to operatic levels with an arsenal of visual tricks includi
 ng split-screen and slow-motion photography. A beautiful 35mm print from 
 the Wisconsin Center for Film & Theater Research\, will screen in honor o
 f Carrie’s 50th anniversary.\n\nhttps://cinema.wisc.edu/events/carrie/\
 n\nSource: UW Cinematheque
URL:https://cinema.wisc.edu/events/carrie/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:cinematheque-2814-0-1793926800@cinema.wisc.edu
DTSTAMP:20261106T010000Z
DTSTART:20261106T010000Z
DTEND:20261106T030200Z
SUMMARY:CLUB KID
LOCATION:UW Cinematheque\, 4070 Vilas Hall\, 821 University Ave\, Madison\
 , WI 53706
