SUMMARY:EEGA
LOCATION:UW Cinematheque\, 4070 Vilas Hall\, 821 University Ave\, Madison\
 , WI 53706
DESCRIPTION:India | 2012 | DCP | 145 min. | Telugu with English subtitles\
 n\nDirector: S.S. Rajamouli\n\nCast: Sudeep\, Nani\, Samantha Ruth Prabhu
 \n\nNani and Bindhu’s young love is cut short when Nani is ruthlessly m
 urdered by his romantic rival\, Sandeep. But Nani’s devotion to Bindhu 
 proves stronger than death—reincarnated as a common housefly\, Nani see
 ks his revenge. Rajamouli’s wildly entertaining spectacle piles one gon
 zo set-piece on top of another\, and will have you cheering on this cunni
 ng bug like an action hero. Move over\, Brundlefly\, step aside\, Ant-Man
 \, make way for Eega! “Completely insane\, endlessly enjoyable\, and ab
 solutely unique” (Screen Anarchy). (MK)\n\nhttps://cinema.wisc.edu/even
 ts/eega/\n\nSource: UW Cinematheque
URL:https://cinema.wisc.edu/events/eega/
END:VEVENT
